  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> are complex numbers such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>Re</mo><mfenced><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>Re</mo><mfenced><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>arg</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>,&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to :</p>",
